      "value": "Additional note. In the FBT environment, the \"fake\" tracker of the gamepad appears during the calibration. It sticks at the origin of the playspace, but it can be linked to the foot. So, FBT users also should be aware of this issue.\n\nIn the attached image, I use 5-point tracking. I think the extra sphere in front of the avatar is the gamepad. You can avoid the problem by standing slightly offset from the origin during the calibration.",
